    "gm_notes": "<p>This enormous serpent is capable of squeezing a soldier to death and then swallowing the body whole to be digested slowly. It prefers to hunt by lurking below the surface of water or in tree branches, ready to entangle a meal. This beast was built by selecting a CR 6 Serpentine and giving it the constrict, camouflage, and hold breath abilities so that it can lay in wait for prey.</p><p>Example beast, Core Rulebook pp.314-317.</p>",
